    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927420/extras/629c0626bef2158e77d4c87d9c36921f.avif?t=1740407711\" width=800 height=173 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moon Rat is a platform game about animals, rats, and cheese. Explore different locations in side-scroll levels, full of secrets, and interact with other animals, to get to the finish line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change between being a rat, running and using ramps to propel yourself, or using the strange properties of the lunar cheese to change the gravity around you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927420/extras/586f690e282253d1bff8cb908fc36ab6.avif?t=1740407711\" width=800 height=204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control Rat, an small animal who is Interested in all the cheese that fell from the moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, another Rat have arrived and wants to get not only the cheese, but all the\u00a0animals' belongings! maybe your robbed cheese is part of something bigger. Your mission is recover all the cheese that you can, while you explore the forest and meet other animals who are willing to help... or maybe not!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This game includes...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast gameplay with levels full of secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple levels divided in different worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Dialogs and Minigames</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn Art and Animation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute Forest Animals (but some of them are aggresive) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheese</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927420/extras/629c0626bef2158e77d4c87d9c36921f.avif?t=1740407711\" width=800 height=173 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Moon Rat is a platform game about animals, rats, and cheese. Explore different locations in side-scroll levels, full of secrets, and interact with other animals, to get to the finish line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change between being a rat, running and using ramps to propel yourself, or using the strange properties of the lunar cheese to change the gravity around you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2927420/extras/586f690e282253d1bff8cb908fc36ab6.avif?t=1740407711\" width=800 height=204 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You control Rat, an small animal who is Interested in all the cheese that fell from the moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, another Rat have arrived and wants to get not only the cheese, but all the\u00a0animals' belongings! maybe your robbed cheese is part of something bigger. Your mission is recover all the cheese that you can, while you explore the forest and meet other animals who are willing to help... or maybe not!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This game includes...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast gameplay with levels full of secrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple levels divided in different worlds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Dialogs and Minigames</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn Art and Animation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cute Forest Animals (but some of them are aggresive) </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheese</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A charming platformer game about a Rat who embarks on an adventure where you collect cheese with properties that are out of this world.",
